WEBVTT

00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:01.026
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.162 --> 00:00:03.924
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I used to be good at maths.

00:00:06.209 --> 00:00:06.784
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.348
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> We used to hate the history teacher.

00:00:12.474 --> 00:00:13.166
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:14.283 --> 00:00:16.523
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> My sister didn’t use to like school.

00:00:18.915 --> 00:00:19.618
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:23.097
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> We didn’t use to wear a uniform.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:25.926
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:27.009 --> 00:00:28.895
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I used to love languages.

00:00:31.069 --> 00:00:31.834
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:33.082 --> 00:00:35.796
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Did you use to play football in PE?